OL,3,GNEWSABBC local radio veteran to retire
OL,4,Aafter 30 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FVeteran BBC Radio Merseyside presenter
OL,7,FSean Styles has announced his
OL,8,Fretirement from the station after
OL,9,Fnearly 30 years.
OL,11,FStyles, who currently presents weekend
OL,12,Fprogrammes, will broadcast his final
OL,13,Fshow on 22 November.
OL,15,FRevealing the news live on air, he told
OL,16,Flisteners: "It's quite an
OL,17,Funderstatement for me to say I've loved
OL,18,Fevery minute of it," and added that he
OL,19,Fwould be "forever grateful for all the
OL,20,Fpeople who have tuned in because they
OL,21,Fhave made it".
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
